The screen stays awake while you are talking to the watch. Voice is the one thing you do without touching it, so nothing was keeping the display on and it could go dark mid-command, taking the microphone with it. It stays lit through the whole thing now, and for a few seconds after.

A sent command keeps the screen up until the door really moves, and the voice screen steps aside once it does, so you see the door animate instead of a microphone on top of it.
